    "detailed_description": "<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/60137f2a1421ba372ac1186e2201e313.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=335 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPPORT ON KICKSTARTER!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Indie-game projects need your help.</i></strong> Working on a game like Pi\u00f1ata Puppy World, we're really invested in making a game and experience that feels incredibly nostalgic, but without a budget it limits and constricts the ability to build the story and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need to reach our <strong>Kickstarter goal</strong> to pay and empower the development team and release the game we want. However! The more we raise, the highest priority the release is, letting us work full-time on it while still support ourselves, and the more we can expand the world and project.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/21c4a24e92f546a50049ce8998a638a4.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=486 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/381bbb42aacdbbd551fc1576e7496b7f.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pi\u00f1ata Puppy World is a <strong>nostalgia-driven</strong> explorative campaign game inspired by the 2000s, featuring an emotional and\u00a0<strong>surreal storyline</strong> where players explore their past through the lens of a <strong>grainy VHS camera</strong>, disguised within the genre of \u201cMascot Horror\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/f529d765fec3bf8b0ec2f5a75b02b7e6.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=377 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Have you ever seen a picture of a childhood memory and felt like you belonged there?\u00a0</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the lens of a <strong>VHS camcorder</strong>, we want to bring you back in time to step foot into the <i>places from your past</i>. The exploration<strong> </strong>based gameplay is able to tackle and tell you, the player, a story about nostalgia as we figuratively step into the past, via walking through the old memories &amp; location of the children\u2019s center, \u201cPi\u00f1ata Puppy World\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/dddac3de75c59423e42ef5d92255734c.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camcorder First-Person Perspective</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyper Realism Graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connected evolving story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2000\u2019s Aesthetics &amp; Locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Platforms (Push Goal) &amp; Performance Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/8b6a45ce13417484331ab3163e33c0ae.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=459 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to explore the <strong>mental health struggles</strong> and <strong>complex emotions</strong> tied to <strong>nostalgic depression</strong>. By expanding on the immersive feeling of <i>liminality</i> and its connection to mental well-being, we strive to create a deeper, more nuanced experience than many common projects in the indie-horror genre have not gone in-depth in. Our game tries to take a deeper approach to evoke the profound feelings of nostalgic depression in ways we haven\u2019t seen explored before.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/21c4a24e92f546a50049ce8998a638a4.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=486 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/381bbb42aacdbbd551fc1576e7496b7f.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pi\u00f1ata Puppy World is a <strong>nostalgia-driven</strong> explorative campaign game inspired by the 2000s, featuring an emotional and\u00a0<strong>surreal storyline</strong> where players explore their past through the lens of a <strong>grainy VHS camera</strong>, disguised within the genre of \u201cMascot Horror\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/f529d765fec3bf8b0ec2f5a75b02b7e6.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=377 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Have you ever seen a picture of a childhood memory and felt like you belonged there?\u00a0</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the lens of a <strong>VHS camcorder</strong>, we want to bring you back in time to step foot into the <i>places from your past</i>. The exploration<strong> </strong>based gameplay is able to tackle and tell you, the player, a story about nostalgia as we figuratively step into the past, via walking through the old memories &amp; location of the children\u2019s center, \u201cPi\u00f1ata Puppy World\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/dddac3de75c59423e42ef5d92255734c.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camcorder First-Person Perspective</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyper Realism Graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connected evolving story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2000\u2019s Aesthetics &amp; Locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Platforms (Push Goal) &amp; Performance Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363050/extras/8b6a45ce13417484331ab3163e33c0ae.avif?t=1752365911\" data-has-big width=800 height=459 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to explore the <strong>mental health struggles</strong> and <strong>complex emotions</strong> tied to <strong>nostalgic depression</strong>. By expanding on the immersive feeling of <i>liminality</i> and its connection to mental well-being, we strive to create a deeper, more nuanced experience than many common projects in the indie-horror genre have not gone in-depth in. Our game tries to take a deeper approach to evoke the profound feelings of nostalgic depression in ways we haven\u2019t seen explored before.</p>",
